Passphrase word table
---------------------
KeySmith consumes `englishid::WORD_LIST` from the EnglishId Rust crate. EnglishId is distributed under the MIT License OR Apache License 2.0, and its documentation states that the 8,192-entry table is based on a word list created by the Electronic Frontier Foundation (EFF).

EnglishId project: https://github.com/khonsulabs/englishid
EFF passphrase word-list background: https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/07/new-wordlists-random-passphrases

See Cargo.lock for the resolved dependency versions and deny.toml for KeySmith's automated dependency-license policy.
